# Claude earthenware-computer archive

> A Claude conversation archive on the Earthenware Computer / 3XB demo thread.

## Purpose
Explain this repo as saved talk, not as the live site. Source: fitzyracing1/claude-earthenware-computer.

## How it works (plain English)
1. Keep the chat history in this repo.
2. Use it to recall Earthenware Computer talk.
3. Use earthenwarecomputer.com or related repos for the running system.

## Key ideas
- Conversation archive
- Earthenware Computer thread
- Family of claude-* repos

## The actual code
```
# source: fitzyracing1/claude-earthenware-computer
archive = conversation_shelf("earthenware-computer")
read(archive)
```

## Line-by-line translation
1. conversation_shelf(...) → “this folder holds that thread”
2. read(archive) → “open the saved talk”

## Decisions the program makes
- If a reader wants the live demo → send them to the site or Goal repo
- If a reader wants the chat → stay here

## What a person would notice
Talk about the computer, not the running API.

## Current status
Barrage clone.

## Next possible steps
Open the archive.
